"""Seed for techniques.json, signatures.json and verification.json (claim-level evidence + conflicts).
Every claim = one statement about one entity field, from one source, with a locator (URL/section) where possible.
Several claims with the same conflict_group disagree with each other; the conflict is described in F."""
D = "2026-11-10"
def os_(path): return f"https://olnickspanu.com/{path}/"

